{"sym":"VIST","name":"Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V.","crypto":false,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","country":"Mexico","employees":584,"website":"https://vistaenergy.com","exchange":"NYSE","summary":"Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V., through its subsidiaries, engages in the exploration and production of oil and gas in Latin America. The company's principal assets is situated in the Vaca Muerta play, Neuquina basin, Argentina. It owns producing assets in Argentina and Mexico. In addition, the company involved in drilling and workover activities situated in Argentina. The company was formerly known as Vista Oil & Gas, S.A.B. de C.V. and changed its name to Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V. in April 2022. Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V. was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Mexico City, Mexico.","ko":{"overview":"비스타 에너지는 중남미에서 석유·가스를 탐사하고 생산하는 회사입니다. 핵심 자산은 아르헨티나 네우켄 분지의 바카 무에르타 셰일 지대에 있고, 아르헨티나와 멕시코에 생산 자산을 보유하고 있습니다. 본사는 멕시코시티에 있습니다.","segments":["바카 무에르타 셰일 석유·가스 생산","아르헨티나 시추 및 유정 보수"]},"price":74.84,"prev":70.61,"mc":8278606336,"next":{"date":"2026-10-28","timing":"amc","ts":"2026-10-28T20:00Z","estimated":false,"eps_avg":43.469,"eps_lo":33.29,"eps_hi":51.583,"rev_avg":1195108130,"rev_lo":1131158020,"rev_hi":1319000000},"fin":{"rev":3525113088,"rev_g":1.023,"eps_g":0.298,"gm":0.8252,"om":0.4424,"pm":0.2356,"roe":0.2979,"fcf":123169128},"val":{"pe":10.01,"fpe":7.2,"peg":null,"ps":2.35,"pb":2.5,"ev_ebitda":5.44,"eps":7.48,"div":0.0},"health":{"cash":606814016,"debt":3754568960,"de":106.5,"cr":0.69,"short":0.0265,"short_days":2.0,"inst":0.6132,"insider":0.1174,"beta":-0.46,"avg_vol":1013515},"analyst":{"mean":91.73,"lo":74.64,"hi":112.21,"n":12,"key":"strong_buy","dist":[4,8,0,0,0]},"ret":{"1w":0.0402,"1m":0.0958,"3m":0.1236,"6m":0.0557,"ytd":0.538,"1y":1.0993,"spy1y":0.1503},"vol3m":0.4308,"hi52":79.25,"lo52":39.74,"ohlc":[["2024-10-21",48.75,49.24,48.2,48.34,511700,48.325,42.731,51.8],["2024-10-22",48.34,48.7,47.16,47.67,754400,48.303,42.821,49.1],["2024-10-23"